{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00730","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享隐太子庙乐章 凯安 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享隐太子庙乐章 凯安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天步昔将开，商郊初欲践。\n抚戎金阵廓，贰极瑶图阐。\n鸡戟遂崇仪，龙楼期好善。\n弄兵隳震业，啓圣隆嗣典。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}